    <!--
      TAMIL-REVIEW
      CLAUDE.md #8, stated to the person holding the phone. These three describe
      the three states PrivacyMask can be in, and the screen shows exactly the
      one that is true right now. They must always agree with what was actually
      written to disk — that is the whole invariant PrivacyMask holds.

