                            image is the raw capture, and the line says so.
      scan_mask_active    — a masker ran. People in frame are painted out of the
                            saved image. Deliberately does NOT name the
                            accelerator: that belongs beside the latency figure,
                            not in the promise, and no buyer needs the word NPU
                            to understand what was saved.
